<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Haupaix et al. (2018) & Inaba et al. (2019) somite-prepatterned Agouti signaling and melanocyte gap-junction reaction-diffusion in galliform plumage stripes — Model fidelity to source: 48/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Evaluates a static 1D sum of Gaussians (`simulate_somite_agouti_1d`, L24-39) without integrating the 2D reaction-diffusion PDE coupling somite-derived dermal *Agouti* (*Asip*) prepatterning with Connexin40-mediated melanocyte lateral inhibition (Haupaix et al. 2018 Figs. 1-4; Inaba et al. 2019 Figs. 2-4), and omits heterospecific somite grafting and exogenous *Agouti* bead dynamics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py L24–L39: Static 1D Gaussian profile without 2D somite-Agouti + melanocyte reaction-diffusion PDE <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/8871db0/2018-haupaix-avian-plumage-somite-stripes.py#L24-L39>" ;
    pk:hasScore 4.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

